     "title": "Leapmotor's sub-$10,000 A10 SUV hits 100,000-unit production milestone 135 days after launch",
     "url": "https://cnevpost.com/2026/08/07/leapmotor-a10-100000-production-milestone/",
     "time": "08-07 12:10",
