     "content": "Replimune melanoma drug snags coveted FDA approval after yearlong clash, two rejections\nReplimune can finally feel a sense of vindication.\nAfter two rejections, public clashing with the previous FDA leaders and a closed-door meeting with the White …\nSign up to read this article for free.\nGet free access to a limited number of articles, plus choose newsletters to get straight to your inbox.",
