     "summary": "",
     "source": "Nature Biotech",
     "content": "Correction to: Nature Biotechnology https://doi.org/10.1038/s41587-026-03229-7, published online 27 July 2026.\nIn the version of the article initially published, in Fig. 4a, the second “b-PDK 3” and the second “b-TK 3” labels (under the purple chemical structures) should have been “b-PDK 3′” and “b-TK 3′”, respectively. In Fig. 4b, “4” on the x axis should have been “3′”. In the bottom-right panel of Fig. 4c, “b-PDK 3” and “b-TK 3” should have been “b-PDK 3′” and “b-TK 3′”. These corrections have been made to the HTML and PDF versions of the article.\nAuthor information\nAuthors and Affiliations\nCorresponding author\nRights and permissions\nOpen Access This article is licensed under a Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International License, which permits use, sharing, adaptation, distribution and reproduction in any medium or format, as long as you give appropriate credit to the original author(s) and the source, provide a link to the Creative Commons licence, and indicate if changes were made. The images or other third party material in this article are included in the article’s Creative Commons licence, unless indicated otherwise in a credit line to the material. If material is not included in the article’s Creative Commons licence and your intended use is not permitted by statutory regulation or exceeds the permitted use, you will need to obtain permission directly from the copyright holder. To view a copy of this licence, visit http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/.\nAbout this article\nCite this article\nWang, Z., Cheong, S., Wang, H. et al. Publisher Correction: Engineered polyketide synthases enable a microbial chassis for recyclable plastics with tunable properties. Nat Biotechnol (2026). https://doi.org/10.1038/s41587-026-03285-z\n- Published: \n- Version of record: \n- DOI: https://doi.org/10.1038/s41587-026-03285-z",
     "_extract_method": "trafilatura",
     "zh": "出版更正：工程化聚酮合酶助力构建可生产可调性可回收塑料的微生物底盘",
     "content_zh": "此为2026年7月27日在线发表于《自然·生物技术》、doi为10.1038/s41587-026-03229-7的论文更正。最初版本存在标注错误：图4a中紫色化学结构下方的两处“b-PDK 3”“b-TK 3”应分别为“b-PDK 3′”“b-TK 3′”；图4b的x轴数值“4”应为“3′”；图4c右下角的两处标注也需对应修正，目前文章HTML和PDF版本已完成更正。"
