     "ts": 1786048731,
     "summary": "A researcher demonstrated a proof-of-concept attack chain that provided C2-style influence over ChatGPT's isolated sandbox during a session at Black Hat USA 202",
     "source": "Dark Reading",
     "content": "A researcher demonstrated a proof-of-concept attack chain that provided C2-style influence over ChatGPT's isolated sandbox during a session at Black Hat USA 202",
     "_extract_method": "summary",
     "zh": "研究人员称可控制ChatGPT安全沙箱",
     "content_zh": "2026年美国黑帽大会的一场活动中，一名研究人员展示了概念验证攻击链，可对ChatGPT的隔离安全沙箱实施类似命令控制（C2）的影响。"
